    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Account Details</b><br/>
Account name: Prime Choice Marketing Inc.<br/>
Package value: $1199<br/>
Account ID: 1025168<br/>
List ID: 1336263_<br/>
Campaign ID : *3398528269 *<br/>
Segment ID : 1203407385<br/>
Connection: Private SMTP Connections</p>

<p><b>Description</b><br/>
Campaign is targeting significantly fewer contacts than expected due to quota limitations.<br/>
For example, Campaign ID: 3398528269 (Campaign quota is set to ~80k contacts and the total segment count is 259,041 contacts), but the campaign sent to only 53k contacts.</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://ongage.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/76832" alt="image-20260618-203157.png" width="1159" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>



<p><b>Product Area</b><br/>
Campaigns</p>

<p><b>Steps to Reproduce</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Go To List-ID: 1336263_&gt;&gt;Campaigns&gt;&gt;Overview&gt;&gt;Campaign IDs: <b>3398528269</b></li>
	<li>Check campaigns&gt;overview&gt;snapshot</li>
	<li>Check Campaigns in the Slavik</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Result</b><br/>
The campaign picked up significantly fewer contacts than anticipated, resulting in a lower targeted audience count.</p>

<p><b>Expected</b><br/>
The campaign should target and pick up all eligible contacts in accordance with the configured audience criteria and available quota allocation.</p>

<p><b>Things we Tried</b><br/>
Reviewed the campaign configuration and verified the quota settings.<br/>
We reviewed the campaign configuration, verified the ESP and Global quota settings across the selected ESP connections, and compared the configured quotas with the actual contacts picked up by the campaign. We observed that the campaign picked up <b>53k contacts</b> instead of the expected <b>80k contacts.</b></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://ongage.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/76830" alt="image-20260618-203024.png" width="1159" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>


<p>We have checked the quota distribution settings and verified that quotas are configured across multiple ESP connections.</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://ongage.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/76831" alt="image-20260618-203222.png" width="1159" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>We have checked the campaign targeting summary and observed that a significant number of contacts were excluded due to quota limitations.</p>


<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://ongage.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/76829" alt="image-20260618-203258.png" width="1159" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><a href="https://ongage.zendesk.com/attachments/token/1kMIUdiBHNG6977hxnHRqivEu/?name=image.png" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Attachment - image.png</a>[http://appweb-1.vpc.ongage.net/tools/web/index.php?path=campaign%2Fhistory&amp;cid=3398528269|http://appweb-1.vpc.ongage.net/tools/web/index.php?path=campaign%2Fhistory&amp;cid=3398528269]</p>

<ul>
	<li>Please see Zendesk Support tab for further comments and attachments.</li>
</ul>

            <br/>
        </td>
