        <tr id="comment-body-90780"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>&#8211; This notification was sent from JIRA 
    <span class="jira-issue-macro" data-jira-key="RND-7172" >
                <a href="https://ongage.atlassian.net/browse/RND-7172" class="jira-issue-macro-key issue-link"  title="Campaign Contact Pickup Count Lower Than Expected" >
