            </span>
 to all linked Zendesk Support tickets by Emil Mana. &#8211;</p>

<p>Looks like most of the outgoing emails are from domain gmail.com. all connections had a limit of 3K for gmail so most of the emails exceeded limit. this is why only 53K were sent out. </p>
