        <tr id="comment-body-90870"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>HI <a href="https://ongage.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3Aeab77149-8147-4063-8343-0349dd4c4e88" class="user-hover" rel="557058:eab77149-8147-4063-8343-0349dd4c4e88" data-account-id="557058:eab77149-8147-4063-8343-0349dd4c4e88" accountid="557058:eab77149-8147-4063-8343-0349dd4c4e88" rel="noreferrer">Emil Mana</a> </p>

<p>Client shared latest campaign ID 3399871552:</p>

<ul>
	<li>It had 10 connections used. It was sent to 55k contacts even though the quota was higher.</li>
	<li>It was strange that the system found 5000 Gmail contacts for 9 connections, and it also found 10k non-gmail contacs for first connection. Then not a single contact of “rest of the domains“was picked from the 9 connections the client used.</li>
	<li>Include Segment ID 1207993451, which still contains about 16,790 non-Gmail contacts that should have been targeted in the campaign.</li>
</ul>


<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://ongage.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/77213" alt="image-20260622-070205.png" width="695" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://ongage.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/77214" alt="image-20260622-070229.png" width="695" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-90971"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="557058:eab77149-8147-4063-8343-0349dd4c4e88"
                id="word_commented_557058:eab77149-8147-4063-8343-0349dd4c4e88"
